# Always push

When shipping finished work for this project:

1. Commit relevant changes (do not commit secrets, `.env`, or `node_modules`).
2. **Push to `origin` immediately** — do not ask “say push when ready”.
3. If an API/Edge Function change is part of the fix, deploy `empire-api` as well when that is the usual workflow for the change.
4. Still follow normal commit-message and git-safety rules (no force-push to main, no config rewrites, no amend unless allowed).
